dark_eyes.png: https://iwantcheckmate.com/challenges/dark/dark-eyes.png (2000 px, fetched 2026-11-26) scaled to 512 px, no other edits. Drawn only on the origin square b4.
dark_start.wav, dark_spread.wav, dark_consume.wav: v6 synthesised set (tools/sfx/modes_v6.py), no longer wired since 2026-11-26 (the site plays only the normal capture sound when a piece is consumed).
